%%{init: {"sequence": {"useMaxWidth": false, "actorMargin": 8, "messageMargin": 24, "boxMargin": 8, "noteMargin": 8, "mirrorActors": false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant DEV as You
    participant CC as clang<br/>-target bpf
    participant LB as libbpf
    participant SC as bpf()<br/>syscall
    participant VER as Verifier
    participant JIT as JIT
    participant ATT as Attach pt<br/>(filename_unlinkat)

    DEV->>CC: hello.bpf.c
    CC-->>DEV: hello.bpf.o<br/>(bytecode + BTF)
    DEV->>LB: open object
    LB->>LB: CO-RE relocate<br/>via kernel BTF
    LB->>SC: BPF_PROG_LOAD
    SC->>VER: analyze every<br/>instruction
    alt program is safe
        VER-->>SC: accept
        SC->>JIT: compile<br/>to native
        JIT-->>SC: native code
        SC-->>LB: prog_fd
        LB->>SC: BPF_LINK_CREATE
        SC->>ATT: install<br/>trampoline
        Note over ATT: every call to<br/>filename_unlinkat<br/>invokes your program
    else program is unsafe
        VER-->>SC: reject + log
        SC-->>LB: -EACCES
        LB-->>DEV: verifier log
    end
